[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
Control rules under dynamic wave, SI units - noodl test fixture
Eight independent systems, each an inflow junction Jn -> conduit Cn -> a storage well Wn (a
FUNCTIONAL cylinder, 50 or 20 m2) -> a pump, orifice or weir -> fixed outfall On, with the rules
Rn: 1 pump STATUS by depth, AND and the clock; 2 orifice SETTING with CloseTime 0.01 h and ELSE;
3 weir SETTING, OR and MONTH; 4 PUMP5 speed by a CONTROL curve; 5 PRIORITY; 6 orifice SETTING
by a TIMESERIES; 7 a PID; 8 variable premises (HEAD, a node DEPTH, VOLUME, LINK FLOW, PUMP
STATUS, TIMEOPEN), run with RULE_STEP 00:00:30.

[OPTIONS]
;;Option             Value
FLOW_UNITS           CMS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
