C8   CIRCULAR 0.9 0 0 0 1

[CURVES]
PC1 Pump3 0 0.30
PC1 2 0.25
PC1 4 0.15
PC4 Pump5 0 0.30
PC4 2 0.25
PC4 4 0.15
CC4 Control 0.0 0.3
CC4 1.0 1.0
PC5 Pump3 0 0.18
PC5 2 0.15
PC5 4 0.10
